=== HTML ===
<!-- Every anchor link needs a matching id somewhere on the page -->
<nav>
	<a href="#cats">Cats</a> ·
	<a href="#dogs">Dogs</a> ·
	<a href="#birds">Birds</a> ·
	<a href="#top">Back to top</a>
</nav>

<h2 id="cats">Cats</h2>
<p>Moonbug is a good cat. Minnow is a bad cat. Both are loved equally.</p>
<p style="height: 300px">(pretend there’s a lot more here)</p>

<h2 id="dogs">Dogs</h2>
<p>I don’t have a dog, so I have no opinions to share.</p>
<p style="height: 300px">(pretend there’s a lot more here too)</p>

<h2 id="birds">Birds</h2>
<p>Birds are just cats for people who look up.</p>
<p style="height: 300px">(and here)</p>

<!-- Landing softly instead of snapping -->
<style>
	html {
		scroll-behavior: smooth;
		scroll-padding-top: 16px;
	}
</style>
=== NOTES ===
